    decision('c0378', 'boundary_case', 'Computerized war and disintegration obligations do not establish a post-work production and distribution mechanism.', ['src-eminiar-war-reference'], analysis='The treaty concerns lethal casualty compliance rather than access to ordinary material goods.', follow_up='Keep as an automated-governance comparison.'),
