    decision('c0388', 'needs_evidence', 'Bynar dependence on a master computer does not establish work-independent household access.', ['src-bynar-computer-reference'], analysis='Cybernetic life support and networked thought can coexist with real work and different property systems.', follow_up='Skip deeper lore reconstruction.')
